        {
          "id": "731fghs9tszh",
          "status": "investigating",
          "body": "As a precautionary measure, the Make MCP server now accepts only OAuth connections. SSE and Streamable HTTP connections (URLs ending in /sse or /stream) and access with Make API tokens are no longer supported.\nTo restore access, reconnect your AI client to mcp.make.com/v2 and sign in with your Make account.\n\nSetup guide: https://developers.make.com/mcp-server/connect-using-oauth.\nFor MCP toolboxes, change the URL ending to /stateless. \n\nWe will post an update once the change is complete in all zones.",
